  message: "Positive evidence, 2026-09-28 on dev 51c73cce78 (from INV-suka's premise check, which closes on its kotlin instance and leaves the general claim here): starlark BUILD.bazel with 'def f(x:' (broken signature) then 'def g(): return 2' surveys to the file node only -- f AND g lost, failed_files empty; the clean control emits f and g. Re-enumeration today finds 24 unwired analyzers, the 24 this item lists (the title says 26). css is NOT discriminating: its analyzer emits no symbols even for a clean file, so a css test needs the failed_files entry, not a symbol diff."  # 1a54
